   "index": 21,
   "start": 81.35,
   "dur": 2.85,
   "speech": "图像化编码确实无损。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 84.38,
   "dur": 4.07,
   "speech": "GAF 从对角就能把幅值反解回来。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 88.63,
   "dur": 3.9,
   "speech": "前提是先把序列压到正负一之间。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 92.71,
   "dur": 3.23,
   "speech": "这一步不做，尾巴就被砍掉。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 96.12,
   "dur": 2.49,
   "speech": "但无损不等于有用。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 98.79,
   "dur": 3.37,
   "speech": "信息上限还是一百二十八个点。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 102.34,
   "dur": 4.38,
   "speech": "二十日方向这个标签，本身太接近随机。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 106.9,
   "dur": 3.83,
   "speech": "所以换多好的表示，也画不出信号。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "open",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 110.91,
   "dur": 3.54,
   "speech": "这个结论不好听，但它是数据给的。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 117.86,
   "dur": 2.94,
   "speech": "问题的起点是卷积网络。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 120.98,
   "dur": 3.21,
   "speech": "卷积网络在图像上很强。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 124.37,
   "dur": 3.66,
   "speech": "但它的输入必须是一张二维矩阵。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 128.21,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speech": "股票窗口是一百二十八个数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 131.67,
   "dur": 3.95,
   "speech": "一维序列进卷积，只能用很小的核。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 135.8,
   "dur": 3.45,
   "speech": "感受野小，看不到跨段的结构。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 139.42,
   "dur": 3.33,
   "speech": "所以第一件事：把一维变二维。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 142.93,
   "dur": 3.57,
   "speech": "变的方法有很多，今天挑三种。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 146.68,
   "dur": 3.09,
   "speech": "三种都有明确的数学定义。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 149.94,
   "dur": 2.89,
   "speech": "也都能用几行代码写完。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 153.02,
   "dur": 3.93,
   "speech": "第一种叫 Gramian 角场，简称 GAF。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 157.12,
   "dur": 3.09,
   "speech": "把每个点映射成一个角度。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 160.39,
   "dur": 4.07,
   "speech": "两两夹角取余弦，得到一张对称矩阵。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 164.64,
   "dur": 3.97,
   "speech": "第二种叫马尔可夫转移场，MTF。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 168.79,
   "dur": 3.97,
   "speech": "先把序列分箱，再看箱与箱的转移。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 172.95,
   "dur": 3.37,
   "speech": "矩阵的每个元素是一次转移概率。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 176.5,
   "dur": 3.09,
   "speech": "第三种叫递归图，RP。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 179.77,
   "dur": 3.95,
   "speech": "两个时刻的值足够接近，就点一个点。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 183.9,
   "dur": 4.07,
   "speech": "它画的是轨迹在相空间里踩过的地方。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 188.15,
   "dur": 2.85,
   "speech": "三张图，三种偏置。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 191.17,
   "dur": 2.77,
   "speech": "这里有一个很容易踩的坑。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 194.13,
   "dur": 3.85,
   "speech": "GAF 要求输入落在正负一之间。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 198.16,
   "dur": 4.09,
   "speech": "很多人先做 z-score，再直接进反余弦。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 202.43,
   "dur": 3.93,
   "speech": "z-score 之后，超过一半的点在区间外。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 206.54,
   "dur": 3.95,
   "speech": "实现里通常会截断一下，防止出 NaN。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 210.67,
   "dur": 3.13,
   "speech": "截断不报错，但它改了数据。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 213.98,
   "dur": 4.55,
   "speech": "本集实测：z-score 之后反解误差是一点七。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 218.71,
   "dur": 3.97,
   "speech": "先做 min-max，误差是一乘十的负十六。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 222.87,
   "dur": 4.14,
   "speech": "同一条曲线，差别来自一个前置步骤。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 227.19,
   "dur": 3.61,
   "speech": "这条要写进实现笔记，不是小事。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 230.98,
   "dur": 3.49,
   "speech": "第二个问题是：图有了，谁来判？"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 234.66,
   "dur": 3.81,
   "speech": "一维序列上，我们已经有四个域的特征。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 238.64,
   "dur": 3.88,
   "speech": "时域看形状，ACF 看自相关。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 33,
   "start": 242.7,
   "dur": 3.45,
   "speech": "谱域看周期，shapelet 看子段。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 34,
   "start": 246.33,
   "dur": 2.41,
   "speech": "四个域经常打架。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 35,
   "start": 248.92,
   "dur": 2.49,
   "speech": "打架的时候听谁的？"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 36,
   "start": 251.59,
   "dur": 3.9,
   "speech": "COTE 的答案是：按验证集准确率加权。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 37,
   "start": 255.67,
   "dur": 2.75,
   "speech": "谁的票多就听谁的。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 38,
   "start": 258.6,
   "dur": 3.01,
   "speech": "听起来很合理，但有前提。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 39,
   "start": 261.79,
   "dur": 3.42,
   "speech": "前提是至少有两个域真的强。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 268.62,
   "dur": 3.23,
   "speech": "先把 GAF 的公式写清楚。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 272.03,
   "dur": 3.25,
   "speech": "第一步，把序列压到正负一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 275.46,
   "dur": 3.88,
   "speech": "第二步，每个点取反余弦，得到角度。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 279.52,
   "dur": 3.49,
   "speech": "第三步，对角度做余弦的和差。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 283.2,
   "dur": 4.26,
   "speech": "cos(φi 加 φj) 是 GASF。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 287.64,
   "dur": 4.17,
   "speech": "cos(φi 减 φj) 是 GADF。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 291.98,
   "dur": 2.49,
   "speech": "两个点就能看出来。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 294.65,
   "dur": 4,
   "speech": "序列取零和一，角度是九十度和零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 298.83,
   "dur": 4.41,
   "speech": "GASF 得到负一、零、零、一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 303.41,
   "dur": 3.01,
   "speech": "就是屏幕左侧那四个数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 306.61,
   "dur": 3.23,
   "speech": "GADF 的差别只在符号。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 310.02,
   "dur": 2.53,
   "speech": "对角线永远是零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 312.73,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speech": "因为 φi 减 φi 等于零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 315.95,
   "dur": 3.81,
   "speech": "矩阵是反对称的：转置再取负。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 319.94,
   "dur": 3.88,
   "speech": "黄金值是零、一、负一、零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 323.99,
   "dur": 3.9,
   "speech": "和 GASF 正好错开一个位置。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 328.08,
   "dur": 4,
   "speech": "这不是巧合，是余弦和正弦的区别。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 332.25,
   "dur": 5.03,
   "speech": "GASF 编码幅值，GADF 编码变化方向。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 337.46,
   "dur": 3.64,
   "speech": "两张图叠起来，才是一个完整表示。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 341.28,
   "dur": 3.78,
   "speech": "本集只用 GASF，因为它更稳。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 345.24,
   "dur": 2.97,
   "speech": "MTF 的第一步是分箱。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 348.39,
   "dur": 3.83,
   "speech": "本集用分位数，把序列切成八箱。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 352.4,
   "dur": 2.75,
   "speech": "为什么不等等宽的分法？"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 355.33,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speech": "股票收益是长尾的。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 358.07,
   "dur": 3.83,
   "speech": "等宽会把九成观测塞进中间一箱。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 362.08,
   "dur": 3.59,
   "speech": "分位数保证每箱差不多一样多人。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 365.85,
   "dur": 3.35,
   "speech": "第二步，数箱与箱之间的转移。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 369.38,
   "dur": 3.59,
   "speech": "第三步，把转移概率摊成矩阵。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 373.15,
   "dur": 4.12,
   "speech": "两箱、序列零一零，得到三行三列。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 377.45,
   "dur": 4.33,
   "speech": "行和都是百分之百，这是转移矩阵的性质。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 381.96,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speech": "递归图最简单，也最直观。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 385.42,
   "dur": 4.12,
   "speech": "两个时刻的值差得比阈值小，就画点。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 389.72,
   "dur": 3.88,
   "speech": "阈值取很小，图里就只剩对角线。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 33,
   "start": 393.77,
   "dur": 4.14,
   "speech": "序列零一二，阈值零点五，得到单位阵。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 34,
   "start": 398.1,
   "dur": 4.09,
   "speech": "阈值放大到二点五，整张图全是一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 35,
   "start": 402.37,
   "dur": 3.54,
   "speech": "中间还有一档，会画出一条带子。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 36,
   "start": 406.09,
   "dur": 4.12,
   "speech": "这条带子的宽度，就是序列的重复结构。"
  },
